This is not a bug, but a configuration issue. You need wildcards for the servers. Change it to this and it will work like you want:

```jsonc
    "tools": {
        "mcp-*": false
    },
    "agent": {
        "plan": {
            "tools": {
                // note the `*`'s
                "mcp-github*": true,
                "mcp-context7*": true,
                "mcp-ddg-search*": true
            }
        },
    }
```

